      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "APPEARED (1) was terrific late in his Australian debut off a long break at Newcastle and he looks a promising stayer for the Baker yard. Appears the logical stepping stone and is the one to beat. FORBIDDEN RIFF (2) ran headfirst into Aethelwulf two back then found another handy one in Foire De Trone last time. He was good without threatening in both and may have bumped into another smart one here. SUNBURNT COUNTRY (6) deserves his shot in town after an arrogant Acton win at Canberra and with the 3kg claim he gets in at a featherweight. He can find the frame without surprising. PROXIMA CENTAURI (7) is on the quick back up from Gosford and his peaks say he can punch out a minor placing.",
